Q: Dropdown is disappering from the screen when a popup is opened from that page A: <p>IE6 had layering issues with form controls. A workaround is to place an invisible iframe behind overlays:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;iframe id=&quot;shim&quot; style=&quot;
    position:absolute;
    top:0;
    left:0;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    z-index:1;
    filter:alpha(opacity=0);
&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
</code></pre>
